msgstr "Résumé (IA)"

#. module: bf_cx_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_cx_ai.field_bf_cx_feedback__ai_analyzed
msgid ""
"Ticked after an analysis attempt that went through: keeps the automatic "
"processing from going over the same feedback again."
msgstr ""
"Coché après une tentative d'analyse aboutie : empêche le traitement "
"automatique de repasser sur le même feedback."

